flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> agent
    agent["<b>agent_node</b><br/>ChatModel.invoke(state.messages)<br/>→ appends AIMessage"]
    tools["<b>tools_node</b><br/>for each tc in AIMessage.tool_calls:<br/>execute tool → append ToolMessage"]
    ENDs([END])
    ENDf([END])

    agent -->|route_after_agent<br/>has tool_calls| tools
    agent -.->|route_after_agent<br/>no tool_calls<br/><i>safety fallback / Ollama primary exit</i>| ENDs
    tools -->|route_after_tools<br/>sentinel NOT called| agent
    tools -->|route_after_tools<br/>finish sentinel called| ENDf

    classDef node fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#1a73e8,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef terminal fill:#fff,stroke:#5f6368,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000
    class agent,tools node
    class START,ENDs,ENDf terminal
